---
description: VMAFx workspace build, test, and agent-integration contract
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Use the checked-in `.vscode/` tasks and settings as the canonical workspace
defaults. The native C/C++ language server is clangd; do not enable a second
IntelliSense provider. Meson sources live in `core/`, so configure with
`meson setup <build-dir> core`.

Keep all project agent integrations available. This includes Claude, Codex,
Gemini, Antigravity, Ollama/local agents, Paperclip, Hindsight, and any
repository MCP servers. Do not add these integrations to an ignore, disabled,
or unwanted list.

Before handing off a change, run the smallest applicable checked-in task and
keep generated build output out of the source tree's tracked files.
